        en: 'Implement encode_review(tokens, tok2idx, num_steps) returning a fixed-length index list: map each token through tok2idx, falling back to <unk> for unseen words, truncate at num_steps, then pad with the <pad> index up to the target length. Use the lesson tiny vocabulary (it starts with <pad>=0 and <unk>=1).',
