        en: 'In the book BiRNN (s2), the last-layer hidden states at the initial and final time steps of a bidirectional LSTM with num_hiddens=100 are concatenated, then fed to a fully connected layer with two outputs (positive/negative). How many parameters does this layer hold (weights + biases)? Answer with an integer.',
      },
      answer: '802',
